<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img class="phero-img" src="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fallen-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fallen-tree.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/ct-claim-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Fallen Tree Claim Calculator</span></nav><p class="kicker kicker-light">Free calculator</p><h1>Fallen Tree Insurance Claim Calculator</h1><p class="phero-lede">After a nor’easter or tropical storm, tree claims mix three different coverages. This calculator separates them so you can see why the check may not match the tree service bill.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool" data-tool="tree">
